{
  "id": "E125",
  "title": "How to Learn the “Ba” Structure",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-06-25",
  "synopsis": "The best way to learn a grammar point is by practicing it.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/454/9e918c9257dc873409ec6ea63f779b6ba020a340.mp3?1496728794",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "怎么学习“把”字句\n\n保罗：王力，你可以帮我个忙吗？\n王力：当然可以，什么事？\n保罗：可以把柜子门打开吗？\n王力：好，你要拿什么？\n保罗：把茶叶拿过来。\n王力：哦，给你。\n保罗：把我的杯子放在桌子上。\n王力：好的……还有吗？\n保罗：把茶叶放进杯子里，再把开水倒进茶杯里。\n王力：你可以直接说：“给我一杯茶。”\n保罗：不行，我在练习怎么用“把”字句。谢谢你的茶！",
    "traditional": "怎麼學習“把”字句\n\n保羅：王力，你可以幫我個忙嗎？\n王力：當然可以，什麼事？\n保羅：可以把櫃子門打開嗎？\n王力：好，你要拿什麼？\n保羅：把茶葉拿過來。\n王力：哦，給你。\n保羅：把我的杯子放在桌子上。\n王力：好的……還有嗎？\n保羅：把茶葉放進杯子裡，再把開水倒進茶杯裡。\n王力：你可以直接說：“給我一杯茶。”\n保羅：不行，我在練習怎麼用“把”字句。謝謝你的茶！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How to learn the “Ba” structure"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：王力，你可以帮我个忙吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：王力，你可以幫我個忙嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wáng lì nǐ kě yǐ bāng wǒ ge máng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Wang Li, could you do me a favor?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "王力：当然可以，什么事？",
      "traditional": "王力：當然可以，什麼事？",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì dāng rán kě yǐ shén me shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Sure, what’s the matter?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：可以把柜子门打开吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：可以把櫃子門打開嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó kě yǐ bǎ guì zi mén dǎ kāi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Could you open the cupboard?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "王力：好，你要拿什么？",
      "traditional": "王力：好，你要拿什麼？",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì hǎo nǐ yào ná shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Ok, what do you want?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：把茶叶拿过来。",
      "traditional": "保羅：把茶葉拿過來。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bǎ chá yè ná guò lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Bring the tea leafs."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "王力：哦，给你。",
      "traditional": "王力：哦，給你。",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì ò gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Here you are."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "保罗：把我的杯子放在桌子上。",
      "traditional": "保羅：把我的杯子放在桌子上。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bǎ wǒ de bēi zi fàng zài zhuō zi shang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Put my cup on the table."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "王力：好的……还有吗？",
      "traditional": "王力：好的……還有嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì hǎo de hái yǒu ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Ok… What else?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "保罗：把茶叶放进杯子里，再把开水倒进茶杯里。",
      "traditional": "保羅：把茶葉放進杯子裡，再把開水倒進茶杯裡。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bǎ chá yè fàng jìn bēi zi lǐ zài bǎ kāi shuǐ dào jìn chá bēi lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Put tea leafs into the cup and then pour some hot water into it."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "王力：你可以直接说：“给我一杯茶。”",
      "traditional": "王力：你可以直接說：“給我一杯茶。”",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì nǐ kě yǐ zhí jiē shuō gěi wǒ yì bēi chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: You could have directly said: “give me a cup of tea”."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "保罗：不行，我在练习怎么用“把”字句。谢谢你的茶！",
      "traditional": "保羅：不行，我在練習怎麼用“把”字句。謝謝你的茶！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bù xíng wǒ zài liàn xí zěn me yòng bǎ zì jù xiè xie nǐ de chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: No, I’m practicing how to use the “Ba” structure. Thanks for the tea!"
    }
  ],
