    "sentence_translations": [
      "How to learn the “Ba” structure",
      "",
      "Paul: Wang Li, could you do me a favor?",
      "",
      "Wang Li: Sure, what’s the matter?",
      "",
      "Paul: Could you open the cupboard?",
      "",
      "Wang Li: Ok, what do you want?",
      "",
      "Paul: Bring the tea leafs.",
      "",
      "Wang Li: Here you are.",
      "",
      "Paul: Put my cup on the table.",
      "",
      "Wang Li: Ok… What else?",
      "",
      "Paul: Put tea leafs into the cup and then pour some hot water into it.",
      "",
      "Wang Li: You could have directly said: “give me a cup of tea”.",
      "",
      "Paul: No, I’m practicing how to use the “Ba” structure. Thanks for the tea!",
      ""
    ]
